const NOMINATION_STEPS=[["Choose the route", "Pick route and the category as written on the organiser's site; record who is nominated (use a reference, not a name, on shared devices)."], ["Consent and eligibility", "Never assign an identity-dependent category (e.g. ethnicity-based) on anyone's behalf - the nominee self-confirms or it is not used; know your departmental approver; open the organiser's current criteria and evidence window; credit consenting co-contributors."], ["Gather evidence", "Add evidence as separate sources; verify attribution, dates, outcomes and metrics against source owners; never overwrite earlier evidence."], ["Draft (STAR)", "Overview (two sentences), Situation, Task, Action (with dates and named co-contributors), Result (measurable outcomes, who benefited). Civil Service Awards: 600 words, about 100 overview + 500 STAR."], ["Review", "A colleague reads the draft; metrics and dates confirmed with the source owner."], ["Prepare and submit", "Confirm approver role (line manager, departmental awards lead) and the organiser's form; submit early. Honours: keep confidential, two support letters not from the nominator."], ["Track and reuse", "Record status, date submitted, outcome and what to reuse; recognise beyond awards without ranking people."]];
